 "about_text": "Marta is a Los Angeles-based, globally-engaged gallery founded in 2019. Its program centers on the space between art and design, giving artists room to experiment with utility and designers room to explore the abandonment of function. Beyond exhibitions, Marta runs curatorial, publication, and podcast initiatives that emphasize the process behind a work's creation as well as the story of its maker. The gallery describes itself as interested in the intersection of disciplines and in advocating for diversity in design and broader public access to the arts. It operates from a space on West Sunset Boulevard in Los Angeles.",
